From: Null IDE <dev@null-ide.local>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 18:29:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agenthost): restore buildForwardedChatError removed by
 VSCodium's copilot-removal patch

VSCodium's 53-ext-copilot-remove-it.patch deletes buildForwardedChatError
(and its copilotApiService.js import) from forwardedChatError.ts as part
of removing GitHub Copilot integration. But claudeProxyService.ts and
codexProxyService.ts (files that patch does not touch) still import and
use buildForwardedChatError for their own CAPI-style error formatting --
it is shared proxy-error plumbing, not Copilot-exclusive code. Restoring
it so the Claude/Codex agent host proxies compile again.
---
 .../node/shared/forwardedChatError.ts         | 57 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 57 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/vs/platform/agentHost/node/shared/forwardedChatError.ts b/src/vs/platform/agentHost/node/shared/forwardedChatError.ts
index 93e95eb..0de32af 100644
--- a/src/vs/platform/agentHost/node/shared/forwardedChatError.ts
+++ b/src/vs/platform/agentHost/node/shared/forwardedChatError.ts
@@ -3,6 +3,8 @@
